<title>FRANCE: Fr. Telecom partial sale decree published.</title>
<headline>Fr. Telecom partial sale decree published.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government decree authorising the partial sale of state telecoms operator France Telecom was published in France's Official Journal dated January 14.</p>
<p>The brief notice said a further decree regarding the sale would be published later in the Official Journal.</p>
</text>
